WEBVTT

00:00.967 --> 00:03.007
♪

00:05.347 --> 00:07.307
-[snoring softly]
-[rattling]

00:13.227 --> 00:14.317
Uh?

00:20.737 --> 00:23.117
Huh? Uh, huh?

00:27.657 --> 00:28.747
[yelps]

00:30.617 --> 00:31.827
[grunts]

00:32.787 --> 00:35.127
Huh? What is this?

00:36.707 --> 00:38.507
[Evi grunting]

00:38.587 --> 00:39.717
-[MAN 1] You haven't seen...
-Floor one,

00:39.797 --> 00:40.757
-done!
-...the last of me!

00:41.387 --> 00:43.137
-[MAN 2] I'm sorry, Mommy!
-Through with floor two!

00:44.177 --> 00:45.387
[ALBERT, EVI] Floor three!

00:46.767 --> 00:48.387
-Here we go.
-Onto floor four.

00:49.017 --> 00:52.267
[MAN] In the end, every battle
ends in one of two ways:

00:52.347 --> 00:55.687
bathed in light
or steeped in darkness!

00:55.767 --> 00:58.397
You defeated the other
Mercross Deathly Kings.

00:58.487 --> 01:01.907
Well, color me impressed
and prepare yourselves!

01:01.987 --> 01:04.237
[yells]

01:06.987 --> 01:09.947
We dethroned those kings
without breaking a sweat.

01:10.037 --> 01:11.417
We don't have time
to waste on you.

01:12.077 --> 01:13.247
He's upstairs, right?

01:13.867 --> 01:17.297
Ha! I can certainly see
how you two made it this far.

01:17.377 --> 01:18.457
However,

01:18.547 --> 01:20.837
if you truly wanna
take a swing at him,

01:21.547 --> 01:22.877
then you'll both have
to earn the right

01:22.967 --> 01:24.967
by getting through me,
Girard Shine!

01:25.637 --> 01:27.307
So then,
which one of you is first?

01:27.387 --> 01:28.597
[grunts]

01:28.677 --> 01:30.427
[♪ opening theme song playing]

01:31.807 --> 01:32.937
-[creaking]
-[chuckles]

01:33.557 --> 01:35.017
Sign me up, Coach Shine.

01:36.267 --> 01:39.357
You got some nice muscles, kid.
[laughs]

01:39.437 --> 01:40.437
[chuckles]

01:42.237 --> 01:43.447
[AMELIA] Um...

01:44.657 --> 01:46.367
This is it, right?

01:46.447 --> 01:48.157
-[doorbell rings]
-[grunts softly]

01:50.037 --> 01:51.327
-[gasps]
-[door creaking]

01:51.407 --> 01:53.707
Should I just go in, then?

01:55.367 --> 01:57.247
Uh, is anyone here?

02:01.087 --> 02:02.207
-[door slams]
-[gasps]

02:03.127 --> 02:04.967
-[exclaims nervously]
-[flame whooshing]

02:06.467 --> 02:07.967
-[door creaking]
-Hmm?

02:15.017 --> 02:16.477
[LIESELOTTE] Ah, Amelia Rose.

02:17.227 --> 02:18.687
-You made it.
-Yes, ma'am.

02:19.397 --> 02:21.477
Nice to meet you, finally.

02:22.107 --> 02:23.567
I am Lieselotte Eden.

02:24.237 --> 02:27.527
Might make more sense if I say
"Sorcerer of Fabrication."

02:27.617 --> 02:28.617
[chuckles awkwardly]

02:29.277 --> 02:30.367
Fabri-what?

02:31.577 --> 02:32.497
No way!

03:00.517 --> 03:02.687
Master Julius.
Good morning, sir.

03:02.777 --> 03:04.397
Ah, good morning, Emma.

03:04.487 --> 03:05.897
[EMMA] Your medicine.

03:06.527 --> 03:07.737
[pills rattling]

03:09.067 --> 03:10.697
-[crunching]
-[EMMA] So strange.

03:10.777 --> 03:12.287
Why does he always chew them up?

03:24.007 --> 03:25.797
♪

03:25.877 --> 03:27.677
My name is Ariane Algren.

03:28.297 --> 03:30.597
It's a great honor
to be in your presence,

03:30.677 --> 03:32.217
a true pleasure to meet you.

03:32.297 --> 03:34.137
My name is Sasha White.

03:34.217 --> 03:35.477
And I'm Luther.

03:35.557 --> 03:36.767
They're my parents.

03:36.847 --> 03:39.057
They're mine, too.
That's my mom and dad.

03:39.147 --> 03:40.097
Oh?

03:40.727 --> 03:42.897
It's cramped, but we hope
you'll enjoy your stay.

03:42.977 --> 03:45.477
Oh, please, I should be
the one apologizing to you

03:45.567 --> 03:47.527
for intruding unexpectedly.

03:47.607 --> 03:49.107
-Ariane.
-Yes?

03:49.857 --> 03:52.157
Our training starts
tomorrow morning, crack of dawn.

03:52.777 --> 03:54.827
You can take Stella's bed
while we stay here.

03:54.907 --> 03:57.117
Uh, but then
where will she sleep?

03:57.197 --> 03:59.287
I usually sleep
in my big brother's bed,

03:59.367 --> 04:00.747
-so you're good.
-Huh?

04:00.827 --> 04:02.497
Yeah, she always does that.

04:02.587 --> 04:03.587
She sleeps...

04:03.667 --> 04:05.337
Bed. You?

04:05.417 --> 04:07.297
Oh, that's our sweet Stella.

04:07.377 --> 04:09.177
She just loves her big brother
so much.

04:09.257 --> 04:11.137
[STELLA]
We take our baths together, too.

04:11.217 --> 04:12.467
-[RAY] Yeah.
-[Sasha chuckles]

04:12.547 --> 04:14.807
-You get along so well.
-[Ray chuckles]

04:14.887 --> 04:16.347
You're kidding, right?

04:16.427 --> 04:17.517
-[ALL] Hmm?
-[STELLA] Huh?

04:17.597 --> 04:18.807
Is something wrong?

04:19.437 --> 04:23.437
[inhales deeply] I need everyone
to line up over there right now!

04:23.517 --> 04:25.817
Now. Now. Now.

04:25.897 --> 04:27.027
Hmm.

04:27.107 --> 04:29.027
-What is this?
-[LUTHER] Um, well.

04:29.647 --> 04:31.947
We were thinking
this might become a problem.

04:32.027 --> 04:34.157
It does look kinda weird, right?

04:34.237 --> 04:35.277
Oh, yeah.

04:35.367 --> 04:37.077
[ARIANE]
That's because it is weird!

04:38.247 --> 04:39.367
-Mm.
-Hmm.

04:39.707 --> 04:41.667
It's one thing to be
really close with your sibling,

04:41.747 --> 04:43.247
but what if
she can never get married

04:43.327 --> 04:44.747
because it weirds out
her suitors?

04:44.837 --> 04:45.957
Good point.

04:46.047 --> 04:47.667
I know! I'll marry my brother.

04:47.757 --> 04:48.837
No! Wrong!

04:48.917 --> 04:51.127
-That is not what I meant!
-Fine then.

04:51.797 --> 04:53.677
-Big brother?
-Yeah? What's up?

04:53.757 --> 04:55.507
Even if we have to be apart,

04:55.597 --> 04:57.887
our relationship will stay
as strong as ever!

04:57.967 --> 04:59.887
Yeah! Strong forever!

05:00.517 --> 05:01.887
You're gonna make me cry.

05:01.977 --> 05:04.017
-I know. They grow up so fast.
-[Sasha whimpers]

05:04.107 --> 05:05.437
-[STELLA] Big Brother!
-[RAY] Stella.

05:05.517 --> 05:06.897
-[STELLA] Big Brother!
-[RAY] Stella.

05:06.977 --> 05:08.437
-[STELLA] Big Brother.
-[RAY] Stella.

05:08.527 --> 05:09.647
-I guess I can see it now.
-[STELLA] Big Brother!

05:09.737 --> 05:10.697
-[RAY] Stella.
-[chuckles softly]

05:11.027 --> 05:13.107
You can tell
they're just loving siblings.

05:13.197 --> 05:14.407
-[STELLA] Yeah.
-[RAY] Right!

05:15.907 --> 05:16.947
So, uh...

05:17.617 --> 05:20.827
-Ray, he sent me to you.
-Yes.

05:20.907 --> 05:22.917
He recently asked
if I could take care of you.

05:23.537 --> 05:24.957
I'm still in Ray's debt.

05:25.037 --> 05:26.957
-You're what?
-That said,

05:27.047 --> 05:29.457
I've taken an interest in you,
Amelia,

05:30.087 --> 05:31.217
more than you know.

05:31.297 --> 05:32.217
Sorry?

05:32.297 --> 05:34.177
-The Butterfly Effect.
-[gasps]

05:35.217 --> 05:36.677
Your original spell,

05:37.507 --> 05:40.267
the magic that interferes
with all causalities.

05:41.267 --> 05:42.847
It filled me with excitement.

05:42.937 --> 05:45.057
Did it really affect you
that much?

05:45.147 --> 05:47.187
However,
when magic is that powerful,

05:47.857 --> 05:50.357
sometimes it ends up
claiming the life of its user.

05:50.857 --> 05:51.897
Which is why...

05:54.027 --> 05:54.947
[Amelia gasps]

05:56.027 --> 05:57.277
I felt the need to ensure

05:57.367 --> 05:59.867
that you had proper guidance
in your training.

05:59.947 --> 06:01.327
Okay.

06:01.407 --> 06:03.907
[yelling]

06:03.997 --> 06:06.327
This ends now!

06:07.787 --> 06:08.957
[groans]

06:09.047 --> 06:10.417
Seems I was wrong.

06:10.507 --> 06:12.047
You can go on ahead.

06:12.127 --> 06:14.427
The man you seek
is on the next floor.

06:14.507 --> 06:16.297
-[groans]
-[body thuds]

06:17.087 --> 06:19.347
-Well done.
-[chuckles]

06:19.427 --> 06:20.467
Thank you.

06:20.557 --> 06:22.727
-Now let's go.
-[chuckles] Yeah.

06:22.807 --> 06:24.477
It's about damn time, bro.

06:25.597 --> 06:27.977
[thudding]

06:33.357 --> 06:34.277
Pardon us.

06:35.197 --> 06:36.317
[ALBERT]
We fought our way up here

06:36.407 --> 06:38.487
because we'd like
to talk to Lucas Forst.

06:40.737 --> 06:41.947
And who are you, then?

06:42.037 --> 06:43.787
-[ALBERT] Ray White.
-Hmm?

06:44.367 --> 06:45.327
That ring a bell?

06:45.657 --> 06:47.377
We wanna challenge him
to a full-on fight.

06:47.457 --> 06:49.287
You do, too, don't ya?

06:49.377 --> 06:51.207
Peerless Blade Sorcerer.

06:51.297 --> 06:53.707
[LUCAS] So I could challenge you
to a real fight.

06:54.417 --> 06:57.137
Now you've seen
the strongest sorcerer around.

06:57.217 --> 06:59.387
It's surely
not the Iceblade anymore.

07:00.257 --> 07:01.507
[ALBERT] The Peerless Blade?

07:02.137 --> 07:04.137
Is that why you've come
to see me?

07:04.217 --> 07:05.767
Yeah. There's only one person

07:05.847 --> 07:07.517
we want on our team,
and that's you.

07:07.597 --> 07:08.767
Is that so?

07:08.857 --> 07:09.767
Well then,

07:09.857 --> 07:11.857
I won't use my blade.

07:11.937 --> 07:13.067
Attack me together.

07:13.857 --> 07:17.447
I want to see your power
and the conviction behind it.

07:18.197 --> 07:20.737
Also, never wear shoes
on tatami mats.

07:20.817 --> 07:22.077
[both grunt]

07:22.157 --> 07:24.537
When you're ready,
let me see what you can do.

07:24.617 --> 07:26.407
[both yelling]

07:29.537 --> 07:31.747
[fight grunts]

07:31.837 --> 07:33.417
[Stella snoring lightly]

07:35.457 --> 07:37.467
[SASHA] To see her brother
finally coming home,

07:37.547 --> 07:39.387
she must have been so delighted.

07:39.467 --> 07:41.717
[ARIANE] Ray and Stella
are like two peas in a pod.

07:41.807 --> 07:43.757
They get along so well.

07:43.847 --> 07:46.427
Right? Almost like
they're actual siblings.

07:46.517 --> 07:48.017
-Huh?
-At first,

07:48.097 --> 07:49.227
the two had a hard time

07:49.307 --> 07:51.227
even being in the same room
as each other.

07:51.307 --> 07:53.687
-What? Are you serious?
-Yes.

07:53.767 --> 07:56.697
A long time ago,
Lydia, my younger sister,

07:56.777 --> 07:58.987
asked if I could take Ray in.

07:59.067 --> 08:01.697
So much has changed
now that I think about it.

08:03.117 --> 08:04.697
-If you would like...
-Huh?

08:05.787 --> 08:07.747
...I can tell you
how Ray was back then.

08:07.827 --> 08:09.287
Yes. Please.

08:09.367 --> 08:10.497
-[door opens]
-Huh?

08:10.577 --> 08:11.747
Ariane?

08:11.827 --> 08:13.837
I wanted to talk to you
about our training.

08:13.917 --> 08:15.207
Uh? Huh?

08:15.297 --> 08:17.337
-What's wrong?
-[exclaims awkwardly] With me?

08:17.417 --> 08:19.217
-I'm not sure what you mean.
-[Sasha chuckles]

08:19.297 --> 08:20.717
Really? Uh...

08:21.337 --> 08:22.547
Stella!

08:22.637 --> 08:24.467
You look adorable
no matter where you sleep,

08:24.557 --> 08:26.267
but you shouldn't be
sleeping on that.

08:26.347 --> 08:28.227
You need to sleep
in your bed instead!

08:29.597 --> 08:32.017
We'll continue this tomorrow.
Okay?

08:32.107 --> 08:33.607
Oh. Yes.

08:33.687 --> 08:34.857
[RAY] Oh, and Ariane?

08:34.937 --> 08:36.227
Yeah? What's up?

08:37.107 --> 08:38.937
We're starting early tomorrow
at 6:00.

08:39.607 --> 08:41.027
You should go to bed soon, too.

08:41.107 --> 08:42.867
Oh. Yes, you're right.

08:45.407 --> 08:46.697
I suppose it's time.

08:46.787 --> 08:48.117
Well, good night to you, ma'am.

08:48.197 --> 08:50.117
Yes. Good night to you, too.

08:51.117 --> 08:53.127
[Stella snoring]

08:54.287 --> 08:57.757
Yeah-huh, look! I can still run.

09:01.927 --> 09:02.967
Got it.

09:04.427 --> 09:05.717
[Albert groaning]

09:05.797 --> 09:06.927
-[panting]
-[EVI] Damn.

09:07.007 --> 09:09.427
We couldn't even
land a single hit.

09:09.517 --> 09:12.097
I know.
The grand sorcerers are no joke.

09:12.187 --> 09:14.437
The fact
you both lasted this long,

09:14.517 --> 09:15.897
it's impressive.

09:15.977 --> 09:18.647
[EVI] To get that praise
from you, it's such an honor.

09:18.737 --> 09:19.737
Next time,

09:20.067 --> 09:22.277
we're at least gonna
knock you back one step.

09:22.357 --> 09:23.657
[both groaning]

09:28.237 --> 09:30.157
I must admit, that was fun.

09:32.657 --> 09:36.707
Albert Allium and Evi Armstrong,
correct?

09:36.787 --> 09:40.417
Ray White,
I'm looking forward to this.

09:42.967 --> 09:44.587
♪

09:44.677 --> 09:47.047
[EMMA] It looks like
you know who will participate.

09:47.137 --> 09:49.057
[JULIUS]
Ah, the Iceblade himself.

09:49.137 --> 09:51.017
[EMMA]
As will the Peerless Blade.

09:51.097 --> 09:52.227
[JULIUS] Oh?

09:52.307 --> 09:53.557
How very interesting.

09:53.637 --> 09:55.267
Even the previous Peerless Blade

09:55.357 --> 09:57.647
had an obsession
with the Iceblade Sorcerer.

09:58.267 --> 10:02.277
Helena Grady, the Grim Reaper,
and the Great Paratrogo,

10:03.107 --> 10:05.157
each one was defeated
by the Iceblade.

10:05.237 --> 10:08.197
Make no mistake,
he's regaining his powers.

10:08.277 --> 10:09.327
If you're right,

10:09.407 --> 10:10.867
then we know that
his "overheating"

10:10.947 --> 10:12.037
raised the temperature,

10:12.117 --> 10:13.957
even for one of the seven grand.

10:14.037 --> 10:17.127
True. We've made numerous
test subjects overheat,

10:17.207 --> 10:18.417
but nothing quite like this.

10:19.127 --> 10:20.377
The only thing we know
for sure is that

10:20.457 --> 10:22.257
the Iceblade's case is special.

10:22.337 --> 10:25.637
Yes, and if so,
we must now look to Akasha.

10:25.717 --> 10:27.007
[blowing]

10:27.097 --> 10:29.597
[ARIANE]
I'm here, but what is Ray doing?

10:29.677 --> 10:32.727
He said he had a few things
he'd like to get set up first.

10:32.807 --> 10:35.687
-Oh, my, just for our training?
-Yep.

10:35.767 --> 10:37.937
So let's hit the Dogma Forest,
okay?

10:39.267 --> 10:40.647
And go!

10:41.317 --> 10:42.187
[exclaims]

10:42.857 --> 10:44.897
-Please wait. I'm not ready.
-Zoom!

10:44.987 --> 10:46.407
Did you hear me, Stella?

10:47.367 --> 10:49.827
-[panting]
-[STELLA] Ariane, this way!

10:49.907 --> 10:51.367
Took you long enough.

10:52.577 --> 10:54.457
Hey!

10:54.537 --> 10:56.497
That was quite a bit farther
than I thought.

10:58.127 --> 11:00.627
I take it
this is the Dogma Forest, then?

11:00.707 --> 11:03.457
Yep. You'll be training here
every day from now on.

11:03.547 --> 11:04.877
I see.

11:04.967 --> 11:06.757
-Good morning, Ariane!
-Uh?

11:07.547 --> 11:10.097
-Ray?
-Oh, what's that?

11:10.177 --> 11:11.047
Huh?

11:11.927 --> 11:13.977
-I said, what's that?
-What's what?

11:15.137 --> 11:16.387
Oh, that!

11:16.887 --> 11:17.847
[Ray grunting]

11:21.687 --> 11:22.937
[exclaims]

11:26.277 --> 11:28.567
Ray, is that you?

11:29.197 --> 11:31.697
[RAY] There is no Ray here,
only Master White!

11:32.327 --> 11:34.537
White Black! [echoes]

11:34.617 --> 11:36.157
[echoing]

11:37.497 --> 11:39.917
From this day forward,
I shall be your instructor.

11:39.997 --> 11:42.787
Uh, Master White in all black?

11:43.497 --> 11:44.547
Okay, wait.

11:44.627 --> 11:47.587
A-Are you Master White
or Master Black?

11:48.217 --> 11:49.677
Listen, Private Ariane.

11:49.757 --> 11:50.757
Yes, sir?

11:50.847 --> 11:52.637
It seems
you've forgotten something,

11:52.717 --> 11:54.767
-that you reply with "roger."
-What?

11:54.847 --> 11:57.017
I said you reply with "roger!"

11:57.677 --> 12:00.517
Roger is what I say. Yes, sir!

12:01.187 --> 12:03.727
Today is your first day
of training.

12:03.817 --> 12:05.647
Bootcamp, Ainsworth-style.

12:05.737 --> 12:07.777
Survival,
real battles, the works.

12:07.857 --> 12:10.777
Prepare yourself! Hah!

12:11.447 --> 12:13.407
-[quivers]
-That's your cue.

12:13.487 --> 12:15.787
Oh. I say, "Roger."

12:15.867 --> 12:18.157
[RAY] Don't say, "I say."
Just say it!

12:18.247 --> 12:20.917
Roger!

12:20.997 --> 12:22.247
Yeah. Now do it again.

12:22.747 --> 12:24.917
Roger, roger!

12:24.997 --> 12:27.967
-ger, ger, ger.

12:28.047 --> 12:31.297
Good. All right, Private,
your training starts right away.

12:31.387 --> 12:32.297
Roger!

12:32.387 --> 12:34.297
It's time you meet my helper.

12:34.387 --> 12:35.507
Your helper?

12:35.887 --> 12:38.477
[STELLA] Top of the morning
to you, Private Ariane!

12:38.557 --> 12:39.687
Stella? Is that...

12:42.307 --> 12:44.187
It is you! [eccoing]

12:46.607 --> 12:48.527
You may refer to me
as Sister White!

12:48.607 --> 12:51.777
White Gray!
This starts right now!

12:53.487 --> 12:56.117
[ARIANE] Gray?
So not white and not black?

12:56.197 --> 12:58.197
Hang on, I don't understand.
Are you--

12:58.287 --> 13:00.077
What, Private?
You got a problem, miss?

13:00.157 --> 13:02.917
I've heard the Dogma Forest
is S-tier difficulty.

13:02.997 --> 13:06.287
-Yeah, so what?
-How are you so blasé? I--

13:07.087 --> 13:08.457
Oh, she's fine.

13:08.547 --> 13:10.837
Trust me, when it comes
to close-quarters combat,

13:10.917 --> 13:12.637
she's every bit as capable
as I am.

13:14.387 --> 13:16.677
The monsters in Dogma
don't stand a chance.

13:16.757 --> 13:18.017
[Ariane exclaims]

13:18.677 --> 13:20.767
I'll be a-okay, Private Ariane.

13:20.847 --> 13:22.347
Uh... [sighs]

13:23.477 --> 13:24.857
I won't argue then.

13:24.937 --> 13:26.767
There's just so much
I wanna say,

13:26.857 --> 13:30.067
but you're my instructors,
and I'll just have to trust you.

13:36.027 --> 13:37.117
Huh?

13:39.327 --> 13:40.537
[growls]

13:41.457 --> 13:43.667
[roars]

13:43.747 --> 13:46.957
-That's a huge scorpion.

13:47.037 --> 13:48.377
-You got this, Ray?

13:48.457 --> 13:50.627
Of course, Big Bro. Uh, Black.

13:52.547 --> 13:54.887
-[ARIANE] What? But she's...
-Hmph.

14:00.727 --> 14:02.597
[exclaims in shock]

14:05.477 --> 14:07.397
Heck yeah! Piece of cake!

14:07.477 --> 14:09.647
-Ray, how did--
-Ray who?

14:09.727 --> 14:10.897
It's White Black.

14:10.987 --> 14:12.777
Right, Master Black.

14:12.857 --> 14:13.737
Now, what's up?

14:14.487 --> 14:17.487
[ARIANE] What did Stella--
I mean, Gray, just do?

14:17.577 --> 14:19.237
-[RAY] She kicked it.
-[ARIANE] Without magic?

14:19.327 --> 14:20.577
[RAY] Just body enhancement.

14:20.657 --> 14:23.077
One hit
with a single body enhancement?

14:23.157 --> 14:25.207
Stel- I mean, Gray's specialty

14:25.287 --> 14:28.127
is finding and exploiting
a creature's weak points.

14:28.207 --> 14:29.997
And if we're talking about
physical prowess

14:30.087 --> 14:31.507
without magical enhancements,

14:31.587 --> 14:33.417
I would say
she's even better than me.

14:34.337 --> 14:36.887
After all, she is a martial arts
specialist.

14:38.097 --> 14:40.387
-Ah.
-Hey, Ariane.

14:40.927 --> 14:43.227
-I'm pretty strong, huh?
-Oh, yes.

14:43.767 --> 14:45.847
You can tell you've got
plenty of training from Ray--

14:45.937 --> 14:47.017
I mean, Master Black.

14:47.107 --> 14:49.817
Master Black and Master Lydia.

14:49.897 --> 14:51.777
Trained by both
the previous Iceblade

14:51.857 --> 14:53.687
and the current one, huh?

14:53.777 --> 14:56.027
Well, that's quite
the elite education, I'd say.

14:57.777 --> 14:59.157
Yes, indeed.

14:59.237 --> 15:02.037
Now, it's time to start
the real battle training.

15:02.117 --> 15:03.117
Ready?

15:03.197 --> 15:04.247
-[ARIANE] Roger!
-Yeah!

15:05.577 --> 15:08.497
[AMELIA] Okay, so is this
where we'll be training?

15:08.577 --> 15:09.537
It is.

15:09.997 --> 15:11.917
But if we're using magic,
the furniture could get-

15:11.997 --> 15:13.797
Don't you worry about a thing.

15:13.877 --> 15:15.297
Huh?

15:15.377 --> 15:16.297
[grunts]

15:19.427 --> 15:20.847
Wait, this is--

15:20.927 --> 15:22.097
Mm-hmm.

15:22.177 --> 15:25.057
A space covered in fabrication,
I suppose.

15:25.727 --> 15:27.977
We're in a space
outside the world we know.

15:28.057 --> 15:29.897
Our magic is safe here.

15:30.687 --> 15:33.107
[AMELIA] This is what
a grand sorcerer is capable of?

15:33.187 --> 15:36.357
Now then, let's discuss the plan
for your training.

15:37.567 --> 15:39.487
If I'm being entirely honest,

15:39.567 --> 15:42.237
your Butterfly Effect spell
outranks my magic.

15:42.327 --> 15:44.697
-Well, I wouldn't say that.
-Still,

15:44.787 --> 15:46.907
I have more experience
as a sorcerer.

15:47.957 --> 15:49.417
But if you look at

15:49.497 --> 15:51.127
the nature of
the Butterfly Effect,

15:51.207 --> 15:53.087
-it's obvious.
-What do you mean?

15:53.707 --> 15:56.337
My magic is only able
to manipulate a small fraction

15:56.417 --> 15:57.797
of the world's causalities,

15:58.257 --> 16:00.757
but yours is able
to manipulate every single one.

16:01.757 --> 16:03.717
You could be one
of the seven grands.

16:04.097 --> 16:05.387
Seriously?

16:06.017 --> 16:07.477
It might be hard to believe
right now,

16:07.557 --> 16:10.097
but I swear it's the truth. Yes.

16:10.857 --> 16:13.147
The seven grand sorcerers
go around.

16:13.227 --> 16:15.527
-[exclaims]
-Now, Amelia Rose,

16:15.607 --> 16:17.647
-shall we begin?
-Oh, yes.

16:18.237 --> 16:20.067
-[snoring]
-[ARIANE] I can't believe it.

16:20.157 --> 16:21.617
You weren't kidding
about Stella.

16:22.277 --> 16:24.077
I simply couldn't keep up
with her.

16:24.157 --> 16:26.997
Yeah, but it's the first time
you fought in the forest, right?

16:27.747 --> 16:29.247
Stella had the upper hand

16:29.327 --> 16:31.497
because she's used to fighting
in this forest.

16:31.577 --> 16:32.627
It's no big deal.

16:32.707 --> 16:33.707
[ARIANE] Regardless,

16:34.207 --> 16:36.127
I was still rather appalled
by my own shortcomings.

16:36.207 --> 16:37.967
[RAY]
That's exactly why we train.

16:38.047 --> 16:40.127
[ARIANE] Right. I'll do my best.

16:41.467 --> 16:42.967
There isn't a single doubt
in my mind

16:43.047 --> 16:44.507
that you can do this, Ariane.

16:47.227 --> 16:48.517
Is something wrong?

16:50.267 --> 16:53.307
-Well, someone's watching us.
-Watching?

16:53.397 --> 16:55.147
[human growling]

16:57.237 --> 16:59.147
Oh, good. It was just a tiger.

16:59.237 --> 17:00.737
What? Uh.

17:00.817 --> 17:02.817
I'm glad it's a tiger
and nothing else.

17:03.447 --> 17:05.407
But that sounded more like a...

17:07.367 --> 17:08.997
[DINA] I can't believe
you decided to go

17:09.077 --> 17:10.497
with a large jungle cat.

17:10.577 --> 17:12.707
We're lucky they didn't find us
in these things.

17:12.787 --> 17:14.127
[MARIA]
I mean, they don't exactly

17:14.207 --> 17:15.917
have house cats around here,
do they?

17:15.997 --> 17:17.547
[DINA] Yeah, whatever.

17:18.707 --> 17:20.007
So what are you thinking?

17:20.087 --> 17:22.007
-About what?
-Them.

17:22.087 --> 17:23.427
Do you think
they were too close?

17:23.507 --> 17:25.047
It's hard to say.

17:25.137 --> 17:27.387
I mean, Ray seems to be
like that with everyone, so--

17:27.467 --> 17:29.017
Not Ray.
I'm talking about Ariane.

17:30.807 --> 17:33.267
Oh, right. Well, clearly,
she doesn't hate the guy.

17:33.347 --> 17:34.557
It appears as though

17:34.647 --> 17:36.817
their relationship
is growing ever closer.

17:36.897 --> 17:39.987
So, you wanna tell me why
we're here wearing these things

17:40.067 --> 17:42.817
and doing
whatever the heck this is?

17:42.897 --> 17:44.157
And also,

17:44.237 --> 17:45.987
how'd you manage to sniff out
Ray's address?

17:46.077 --> 17:48.447
I got it via
the student council's authority.

17:49.577 --> 17:50.947
This is for Rebecca.

17:51.037 --> 17:52.787
Are you sure
that we should be doing this?

17:52.867 --> 17:54.497
It's for Rebecca!

17:55.207 --> 17:57.127
Oh, God.
Can I please go home now?

17:57.207 --> 17:58.747
Absolutely not!

17:58.837 --> 18:01.507
I would be way too freaked out
by myself, okay?

18:01.587 --> 18:02.967
You can go home, too, you know.

18:03.047 --> 18:04.797
-No, not a chance!
-Ugh.

18:04.887 --> 18:05.927
We can't leave.

18:06.217 --> 18:07.597
Someone needs to consider
Rebecca's feelings,

18:07.677 --> 18:09.467
-and we're all she's got.
-Okay.

18:10.097 --> 18:11.217
[BOTH] Huh?

18:13.687 --> 18:15.517
[growls]

18:15.597 --> 18:16.687
[BOTH] Huh?

18:17.607 --> 18:19.817
[both yelping]

18:22.027 --> 18:23.027
[meows]

18:24.857 --> 18:25.947
[RAY] From today on,

18:26.237 --> 18:28.027
we're going to practice
real guerrilla warfare.

18:28.697 --> 18:31.037
We'll analyze various
environments and situations,

18:31.117 --> 18:33.907
and learn how to have
the advantage in every fight.

18:34.367 --> 18:35.287
Do you hear me?

18:37.627 --> 18:38.877
[sighs]

18:38.957 --> 18:40.837
-Ta-da!
-[shrieks]

18:40.917 --> 18:42.797
-Seriously?
-Roger.

18:43.417 --> 18:45.257
[EVI] You ready to hit it hard?

18:45.337 --> 18:47.507
[ALBERT]
Yeah! Our training starts now!

18:52.927 --> 18:55.767
Good. Become one
with the sensation

18:55.847 --> 18:58.767
of the prima materia as it
encircles every inch of you.

19:08.407 --> 19:09.277
Mm?

19:12.367 --> 19:13.827
[yelps]

19:13.907 --> 19:15.827
[grunts, groans]

19:15.907 --> 19:16.787
[gasps]

19:17.667 --> 19:20.287
The ground is so hard.

19:21.497 --> 19:22.797
Master Lieselotte.

19:23.457 --> 19:25.167
Thank you for helping me.

19:25.877 --> 19:26.837
No, please.

19:27.387 --> 19:29.297
Maybe this is how I should
have done it in the past.

19:30.717 --> 19:32.057
[AMELIA] Master Lieselotte?

19:33.017 --> 19:34.387
It's nothing.

19:34.467 --> 19:36.057
So, shall we continue?

19:36.767 --> 19:37.807
Sure.

19:39.267 --> 19:40.357
[Elisa exclaims]

19:40.437 --> 19:42.527
This is way too sudden.

19:42.607 --> 19:44.937
[CLARIS]
Hey, why are you hiding?

19:45.607 --> 19:46.567
Everything all right?

19:46.647 --> 19:48.197
Oh, hey, Claris!

19:48.277 --> 19:49.867
You worried about something?

19:49.947 --> 19:53.367
Oh, no, everything's fine. Yeah.

19:53.447 --> 19:55.197
Uh... [exclaims]

19:56.037 --> 19:58.617
The school feels so empty
with everyone out and about.

19:58.707 --> 20:00.627
You're right, it does.

20:00.707 --> 20:03.547
[CLARIS] I hope they come back
soon before I go crazy.

20:03.627 --> 20:04.997
[ELISA] Yeah, me, too.

20:05.087 --> 20:06.207
I really miss them.

20:07.797 --> 20:08.717
[Ariane sighs]

20:08.797 --> 20:11.717
That was a hard day, but...

20:11.797 --> 20:14.217
-I can toughen up.
-[SASHA] Here.

20:14.847 --> 20:15.717
Huh?

20:15.807 --> 20:17.017
Oh, it's you.

20:17.097 --> 20:19.097
Yes, indeed, a promise kept.

20:20.687 --> 20:23.437
It's been more than three years
since Ray came to us.

20:24.357 --> 20:25.727
My first impression
of him was...

20:26.687 --> 20:29.397
he was rather quiet
for a kid his age.

20:29.487 --> 20:30.737
There was a calmness about him

20:30.817 --> 20:33.157
that you wouldn't expect
from a 12-year-old boy.

20:33.867 --> 20:36.077
Stella was a very shy child,

20:36.157 --> 20:38.407
so she always kept
a cautious eye on him.

20:39.077 --> 20:41.077
-Uh?
-Hard to believe, right?

20:41.707 --> 20:42.917
Yeah, I know.

20:42.997 --> 20:44.337
The only thing I can think

20:44.417 --> 20:45.957
is that it must have been
Ray's aura.

20:46.047 --> 20:47.457
Perhaps that's what
was keeping her

20:47.547 --> 20:48.507
at an arm's length.

20:50.217 --> 20:52.847
Were you ever told the reason
Ray came to live with us?

20:52.927 --> 20:55.307
I was. I heard he left the army,

20:55.387 --> 20:57.557
and it was his master's wish
that he'd stay with you.

20:57.637 --> 21:00.557
Yeah. Lydia entrusted us
with him.

21:01.477 --> 21:03.437
He was only just
a 12-year-old boy,

21:04.187 --> 21:06.027
but he bore witness
to hell on Earth.

21:06.727 --> 21:09.317
-May I ask one question?
-Of course.

21:09.397 --> 21:10.817
[ARIANE] I'm curious,

21:10.897 --> 21:13.567
was there a reason
Lydia asked you to take him?

21:13.657 --> 21:16.737
She said if Ray stayed
with someone who only knew war,

21:16.827 --> 21:18.907
he wouldn't have the chance
to find happiness.

21:19.577 --> 21:21.077
What was important to her

21:21.157 --> 21:24.077
was for Ray to have a normal,
age-appropriate life

21:24.167 --> 21:25.837
away from all the fighting.

21:25.917 --> 21:27.247
[LYDIA]
Can I ask you to do this?

21:27.957 --> 21:30.087
Of all the great people
in my life,

21:30.917 --> 21:32.837
you're the only two I can trust.

21:32.927 --> 21:35.467
We can. Leave it to us, sis.

21:35.547 --> 21:38.677
She's right. It would be lovely
to have a son, too.

21:39.307 --> 21:40.727
[Lydia sighs in relief]

21:40.807 --> 21:41.847
Thank you.

21:43.187 --> 21:46.107
I see. That boy is truly loved.

21:46.187 --> 21:47.567
He's a good son.

21:47.647 --> 21:48.977
Well, that's obvious.

21:49.067 --> 21:50.817
-[RAY] Oh, there you are.
-Oh.

21:50.897 --> 21:52.397
Uh, yeah.

21:52.487 --> 21:54.317
Tomorrow will be harder
than today.

21:54.987 --> 21:57.027
You might wanna go
get some rest.

21:57.117 --> 21:58.367
Yes, of course.

21:58.447 --> 22:00.577
Being up late isn't good
for your skin, Mom.

22:00.657 --> 22:02.247
Right. Thank you.

22:03.867 --> 22:05.077
♪

22:05.167 --> 22:06.417
Cupid!

22:08.797 --> 22:11.707
I've got so much more
to tell you, Ariane.

22:11.797 --> 22:14.587
Huh? Huh? Huh? Huh?

22:14.677 --> 22:16.597
You're gonna
fly past your rivals.

22:16.677 --> 22:17.637
What?

22:18.847 --> 22:21.807
No matter how tough things get,
I'll be rooting for you.

22:22.927 --> 22:24.097
Huh?

22:24.187 --> 22:26.397
[humming]
♪ Da-da-da, da-da-da ♪

22:26.477 --> 22:28.517
♪ Da-da-da, da-da-da ♪

22:28.607 --> 22:30.107
-Good night, Ariane.
-Huh?

22:30.187 --> 22:31.607
See you tomorrow.

22:33.277 --> 22:35.657
-Huh?
-♪ Da-da-da, da-da-da ♪

22:35.737 --> 22:38.367
[ARIANE]
Hang on. Did she say "rivals"?

22:38.447 --> 22:41.367
Also, is there a reason
my heart is about to try

22:41.447 --> 22:43.157
and leap out of my chest?

22:43.247 --> 22:46.667
What in all the stars in the sky
is going on here?!

22:46.747 --> 22:47.667
[RAY] Ariane?

22:49.747 --> 22:51.707
[♪ closing theme song playing]

23:48.847 --> 23:50.437
[RAY]
♪ I am Master White Black! ♪

23:50.517 --> 23:52.187
[STELLA]
♪ I'm Sister White Gray! ♪

23:52.267 --> 23:53.187
And I'm Ariane.

23:54.357 --> 23:55.397
[RAY] This is the preview.

23:55.687 --> 23:56.777
♪ First step toward a new day
With me ♪

23:57.147 --> 23:57.777
-♪ Roger ♪
-♪ Shine bright and grab ♪

23:58.447 --> 23:58.907
-♪ That victory ♪
-♪ Roger ♪

24:00.117 --> 24:00.527
-♪ Adversaries stand no chance ♪
-♪ Roger ♪

24:01.527 --> 24:01.617
-♪ No chance ♪
-[STELLA] Now's the time

24:03.197 --> 24:03.617
-[RAY] Next time...

24:05.037 --> 24:05.327
[STELLA, ARIANE] On The Iceblade
Sorcerer Shall Rule the World...

24:05.407 --> 24:06.367
[ALL] Two!

24:07.497 --> 24:09.327
[ARIANE] Bandying together
for the third time.

24:09.417 --> 24:11.627
[RAY] ”The Boy Who Is the
World’s Strongest Sorcerer...

24:11.707 --> 24:14.087
[STELLA, ARIANE]...Keeps
Winning With His Team!" Roger!
